  "description": "Alpha.3 firmware-first Arduino device-key migration, post-merge Alpha.2 readiness-test alignment, and desktop TypeScript build-gate repair. Node, legacy macOS curl and Tauri clients move the Arduino API key from URL query parameters to X-Device-Key. Firmware 4.1.21 accepts the header first and retains a measurable, compile-time query fallback until hardware and rollout gates pass. The desktop preflight panel, Vite environment typing and Tauri invoke adapter compile under the strict TypeScript build.",
